{
  "job_B8.1.7.2_20251003_114824": {
    "chunk_text": "ig on micelre streng\u00f0e, swa \u00fe\u00e6t he gel\u00e6hte ane leon be wege, \u00fee hine abitan HE begann \u00fea to winnenne wi\u00f0 \u00f0a Philisteos & heora fela ofsloh & to sceame tucode, \u00feeah \u00fee hig \u00d0a ferdon \u00fea Philistei for\u00f0 \u00e6fter Samsone & heton his leode, \u00fe\u00e6t hi hine ageafon to hira anwealde, Hig \u00f0a hine gebundon mid twam b\u00e6stenum rapum & hine gel\u00e6ddon to \u00feam folce. & \u00f0a Philisteiscan \u00fe\u00e6s f\u00e6gnodon swi\u00f0e, urnon him togeanes ealle hlydende, woldon hine tintregian & he gel\u00e6hte \u00f0a sona sumes assan cinban \u00fee he \u00f0\u00e6r funde, & gefeaht wi\u00f0 hig & ofsloh an \u00feusend & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him sylfum: Ic ofsloh witodlice an \u00feusend wera mid \u00fe\u00e6s assan cinbane. He wear\u00f0 \u00fea swi\u00f0e of\u00feyrst for \u00f0am wundorlican slege & b\u00e6d \u00feone heofonlican God, \u00fe\u00e6t he him \u00d0a arn of \u00feam cinbane, of anum te\u00f0, w\u00e6ter, & Samson \u00fea dranc & his Drihtene \u00feancode. Nu gif hwa wundrie, hu hit gewur\u00f0an mihte \u00fe\u00e6t Samson se stranga swa ofslean mihte an \u00feusend Nis \u00feis nan gedwimor ne nan dwollic sagu, ac seo ealde gesetniss ys eall swa trumlic, swa swa se \u00c6FTER \u00feisum he ferde to Philistea lande in to anre birig on heora anwealde, Gaza gehaten. & hi \u00fe\u00e6s f\u00e6gnodon, besetton \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t hus \u00fee he inne wunude, woldon hine geniman, mid \u00feam \u00fee he ut Hw\u00e6t \u00f0a",
